---
source: crates/gough-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: o.out
---
Request a quota increase

Usage: gough storage quota-request [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --tenant-id <TENANT_ID>
          Tenant id
  -o, --output <FORMAT>
          Output format: table, json, yaml or jsonpath=<RFC 9535 expression> [default: table]
      --resource-type <RESOURCE_TYPE>
          Resource type
  -q, --quiet
          Suppress all output except errors
      --requested-value <REQUESTED_VALUE>
          Requested value
      --no-color
          Disable colored output
      --unit <UNIT>
          Unit of the requested value
      --cluster <URL>
          Cluster API URL (env GOUGH_CLUSTER_URL); overrides the config file
      --justification <JUSTIFICATION>
          Why the increase is needed
      --context <NAME>
          Named context from the config file (env GOUGH_CURRENT_CONTEXT)
  -v, --verbose
          Log requests and diagnostics to stderr (tokens are masked)
      --ca-file <FILE>
          Extra PEM CA bundle to trust for the cluster's TLS certificate
  -h, --help
          Print help
